docs {
  ### POST /programmatic/bulkdelete
  
  This endpoint is used to perform a bulk delete operation for multiple items.
  
  #### Request Body
  
  - `ids` (array): An array of item IDs to be deleted.
      
  
  #### Response
  
  - Status: 400
      
  - Content-Type: application/problem+json
      
  - `errors` (object): An object containing error details.
      - `ids` (array): An array of error messages related to the item IDs.
          
  - `title` (string): A title for the error.
      
  - `status` (number): The status code of the error.
      
  - `traceId` (string): A unique identifier for tracing the error.
      
  
  The last call to this endpoint with an empty `ids` array in the request body returned a 400 status with error details in the response.
}
